{"availability":"available","full":"opendilab/LightRFT","name":"LightRFT","description":"LightRFT: Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":397,"forks":12,"created":"2025-12-23T03:58:37Z","updated":"2026-09-07T09:24:55Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT","topics":["dapo","grpo","llm","llm-training","multi-modal","reinforcement-learning","reward-model","rft","vlm"],"demo":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.024Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.024Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.024Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.733Z","stars":399,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:27:03.124Z","stars":397,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.024Z","stars":397,"forks":12}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","LightRFT (Light Reinforcement Fine-Tuning) is a reinforcement fine-tuning framework for large language models (LLMs) and vision-language or multimodal generative models (VLMs). It provides a structured and extensible workflow for reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards (RLVR), reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF), and model-reward-driven policy optimization, covering policy sampling, reward computation, advantage estimation, and policy updates. The repository also includes reward-model training and on-policy distillation workflows.","LightRFT uses torchrun and PyTorch distributed communication as its runtime foundation. A unified Strategy interface connects FSDP v2 and DeepSpeed ZeRO training backends with SGLang and vLLM rollout backends. Current code paths and examples include text, image, video, and audio tasks. “Omni-modal” means that the repository contains dedicated model, data, or example paths for these modalities; it does not imply that every model and modality combination works without adaptation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:08.782Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.113Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Light, Efficient, Omni-modal & Reward-model Driven Reinforcement Fine-Tuning Framework","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.113Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-07T09:24:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opendilab/LightRFT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.115Z","hash":"192ef8da816b2c953302728d3d9317ec17a7f02d61f993292e4cab790db48020","originalBytes":21415,"storedBytes":21415,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:04:12.024Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Science","Image, audio & video AI","Templates & UI components","Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T09:34:09.298Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T09:34:09.298Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T09:34:09.298Z","target":"https://opendilab.github.io/LightRFT/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T09:34:09.298Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T09:34:09.298Z","previewCheck":{"url"